{"success":true,"data":{"name":"Bendy: The Cage","short_description":"Escape a twisted prison filled with the darkest experiments gone wrong, now set loose in the shadows to hunt you down. Unleash your deadly axe in this action psychological horror taking place during the events of Bendy and the Dark Revival®. Fight the madness.","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/extras/514607695fe99375cb7c182b9882bebf.poster.avif?t=1784837657\" width=1024 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/extras/514607695fe99375cb7c182b9882bebf.webm?t=1784837657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your sanity as you take control of Henry in this third person horror experience taking place during the events of Bendy and the Dark Revival®.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Condemned to the Keeper prison known as &quot;The Pit&quot;, Henry must survive the horrific inmates and mangled experiments set loose to devour him. A labyrinth of steel industrial dread lay before him as his mind is invaded by the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the hidden blood-stained truth behind the monsters as you explore the dark levels of The Pit, slowly making your way to the very top of the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the darkness with your axe in brutal melee combat: Unleash fast and heavy strikes, block and parry incoming attacks, shove foes away, stomp on enemies with a vengeance, and time dodges to avoid being torn apart by the things that hunt you. Dive into the shadows for limited supplies as you embark on a twisted tale of Henry's self discovery while facing down new and familiar creatures of the ink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the maestro. Escape the prison. Fight the madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/extras/33cb39d5c565a7e8391c2d1042737a56.avif?t=1784837657\" width=1024 height=246 /></span></p>","genres":[{"id":"1","description":"Экшены"},{"id":"25","description":"Приключенческие игры"},{"id":"23","description":"Инди"},{"id":"3","description":"Ролевые игры"}],"developers":["Joey Drew Studios"],"publishers":["Joey Drew Studios"],"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Скоро выйдет"},"background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/804cede5b7a0bfb463e65f348156e2be82aaa539/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1784837657","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/845692686cfee16d18ef871ecb1ea38f0028db5a/ss_845692686cfee16d18ef871ecb1ea38f0028db5a.600x338.jpg?t=1784837657","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/845692686cfee16d18ef871ecb1ea38f0028db5a/ss_845692686cfee16d18ef871ecb1ea38f0028db5a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784837657"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/e8ab578e9d7debaf2d5c1ee1611112dd21b7fffe/ss_e8ab578e9d7debaf2d5c1ee1611112dd21b7fffe.600x338.jpg?t=1784837657","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/e8ab578e9d7debaf2d5c1ee1611112dd21b7fffe/ss_e8ab578e9d7debaf2d5c1ee1611112dd21b7fffe.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784837657"},{"id":2,"path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/9baaa449e20b84c5cb3445502dda66264038e199/ss_9baaa449e20b84c5cb3445502dda66264038e199.600x338.jpg?t=1784837657","path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663960/9b